  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can apply a hack to an effect that already has a hack without the [utility] tag applied, up to a maximum of three talents if at least one has the [utility] tag.</p>\n<p>If you possess at least 10 ranks in the associated skill, you can also apply up to two (hack) talents at once as a full-round action. Likewise, you can also remove up to two (hack) talents simultaneously. For every talent you do not possess, you must make a separate dispel check to remove it.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/spellhacking#toc22\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
